# Aegis ignore rules for this repository.
#
# Everything listed here is documentation or community material containing
# intentional detection examples (sample keys, traversal strings, payloads).
# Scanning prose produces dashboard noise, not security signal.
#
# Syntax: gitignore-style globs, `!` to re-include, last match wins.
# `.atheonignore` remains supported as a legacy alias for this file.

# Project documentation with deliberate detection examples
docs/

# GitHub wiki mirror (same example content)
.github/wiki/

# Community program descriptions
community/

# All markdown is prose with intentional examples (README, CHANGELOG,
# integration guides) — never executable code
*.md
